      "message": "[warning] Line 118: 🟡 `createActionSeparator` is assumed to be `generalMenuSeparatorList[0]`, but that index depends on which items were visible during `loadMenuItems()`. When \"New editable document\" is initially hidden, index 0 points to the separator between other actions, so this code hides the wrong separator; if only one action is visible, index 0 is undefined and this block will throw at runtime. Track the separator associated with `newEditableDocument` explicitly (or rebuild separators from current visible items) instead of hardcoding index 0.",
